# Build artifacts (regenerate with `just build`)
**/target/
node_modules/
*.gz

# The verifier crates `xark export` writes beside each circuit. They embed a key
# that changes with every setup, so each build makes its own.
*-verifier/

# Rust — commit lockfiles for reproducible example builds
Cargo.lock
!01-over-9000/circuit/Cargo.lock
!01-over-9000/program/Cargo.lock
!02-zkyc/circuit/Cargo.lock
!02-zkyc/program/Cargo.lock
!03-shielded-pool/circuits/deposit/Cargo.lock
!03-shielded-pool/circuits/pool/Cargo.lock
!03-shielded-pool/circuits/withdraw/Cargo.lock
!03-shielded-pool/program/Cargo.lock
!04-shielded-transfer/circuits/transact/Cargo.lock
!04-shielded-transfer/program/Cargo.lock

# Anchor
.anchor/
test-ledger/

# Keys & secrets — never commit
*-keypair.json
.env
.gstack/
